Checks for application behavior not yet implemented remain planned coverage,
not successful gate-maintenance results.

Preserve historical sealed plans, recorded contract revisions, IDs, tombstones,
bindings, ledgers, baselines and previous evidence. Assess inherited effects and
affected active tasks. Use supported amendments and applicable approval if an
active plan is materially affected; do not rewrite its sealed records or impose
