Then prepare or amend the actual application plan through supported routes.
Assign exactly one adequate registered tier; include its coverage reference,
baseline declarations and Regression Guard classification/declaration. Keep a
native Plan and its authoritative sealed plan consistent where both exist.
Do not perform implementation or application workloads before valid admission
and applicable approval.

Deliver the required tests and execution wiring with the application change.
Use isolated owned-process fixtures for safety assertions. Keep ordinary port
